<title>CANADA: SOCCER-CANADA BEATS EL SALVADOR IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CANADA BEATS EL SALVADOR IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BURNABY, British Columbia 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada beat El Salvador 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a World Cup CONCACAF semifinal qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Canada - Alex Bunbury (penalty, 65th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,858</p>
